     A*=====================================================================
     A* Sample DDS Printer File: ORDPRTF (Customer Order Summary Report)
     A* Built with IBM i TOBi (makei) -> *FILE (PRTF) - Precedence Tier 40
     A*=====================================================================
     A          R RPTHEAD                   SKIPB(2)
     A                                     2'IBM i CI/CD PACKAGER - CUSTOMER +
     A                                      ORDER REPORT'
     A                                    65'Page:'
     A                                    71PAGNBR EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                      SPACEA(2)
     A          R RPTDTL                    SPACEA(1)
     A            CUSTID         8S 0      2EDTCDE(Z)
     A            CUSTNAME      40A       12
     A            CUSTSTATE      2A       54
     A            CUSTBAL       11S 2     58EDTCDE(J)
